  "full_target": "For every prime p, every field K of characteristic p, every integer lambda with 0 <= lambda < p, and every admissible lattice M in the complex irreducible highest-weight sl2-module V(lambda), prove that M tensor_Z K is irreducible as the scalar-extension Lie algebra L(K)-module.",
